
This tar file contains a complete inxware runtime executable environment.

To install simply expand the tar file to where you want to install the application 
(e.g. in your home directory under ~/apps).

run the install script to install launcher icons in the application menu and desktop.

The runtime environment is self contained, including a copy of glibc if the version on your machine is too old.
By default the runtime will make use of the host's version of glibc, but if this causes problems runtime can 
be made to use the internel version using the following run command:

    ./run_ehs.sh NO_RESTART LIB_INX

Otherwise the (normal) default launch for a production system is

 
    ./run_ehs.sh YES_RESTART LIB_HOST (default paramters)
    

